stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Fetching: first observer mounts, no cache entry
  Fetching --> Fresh: success, data younger than staleTime
  Fresh --> Stale: staleTime elapsed (15 s default here)
  Stale --> Fetching: new observer mounts, invalidateQueries, refetchInterval
  Fresh --> Fetching: invalidateQueries
  Fetching --> Error: failure (retry once for 5xx/network, never for 4xx)
  Error --> Fetching: retry or refetch
  Fresh --> Inactive: last observer unmounts
  Stale --> Inactive: last observer unmounts
  Inactive --> Garbage: gcTime elapsed (5 min default)
  Inactive --> Fresh: observer returns before gc
  Garbage --> [*]
